## SnowGlow client env
#
# Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_.
#
# Backend base URL that provides:
# - GET /extract-audio?url=<youtubeUrl> (레거시)
# - POST /youtube/jobs  body: { "url": "<youtubeUrl>" } → { jobId }
# - GET  /youtube/jobs/:jobId → { status, percent, stage, error? }
# - GET  /youtube/jobs/:jobId/audio → mp3 (완료 후)
#
# Local dev default (if unset): http://localhost:3000
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

